1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,869
Six a.m. One car. One note.

2
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,047
Every green light adds a beat.

3
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,856
The seven-forty brings the bass.

4
